0,Kiwai language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiwai_language,"Kiwai is a Papuan language, or languages, of southern Papua New Guinea.Below are some reflexes of proto-Trans-New Guinea proposed by Pawley (2012). The dialect given is Island Kiwai, unless otherwise indicated.[5].","Kiwai, Southern",Trans-New Guinea
